      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A palladium-catalyzed intramolecular reaction of carboxylic acids and alkynes in a novel cyclization manner was developed. This unique cyclization efficiently provided a wide range of complex ring systems-vinyl dioxanones bearing a quaternary allylic carbon. Mechanistic studies suggest an allenyl carboxylate as an intermediate."},
